    <summary>Official CLI for emaki (emaki.ai), the Japanese-language AI video generator for Seedance 2.5 and Seedance 2.0.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Official CLI for [emaki](https://emaki.ai/?utm_source=chocolatey&utm_medium=package) (emaki.ai), the Japanese-language AI video generator for [Seedance 2.5](https://emaki.ai/seedance-2-5) and [Seedance 2.0](https://emaki.ai/seedance-2). Generate a video clip or an image from the Windows command line; each command prints the URL of the finished file.

```
emaki -credits
emaki "a paper lantern drifting over a night river"
emaki -model seedance_2 -p duration=8 -p resolution=720p "a fox in fresh snow"
emaki -p image=https://example.com/first-frame.jpg "the camera slowly pushes in"
emaki -image "a ramen shop at dusk, isometric"
```

Set `EMAKI_API_KEY` to a key from [emaki.ai/settings/apikeys](https://emaki.ai/settings/apikeys). Each run costs credits on your emaki account, the same price as on the website. Video models: `seedance_2_5` (default), `seedance_2`, `seedance_2_fast`, `seedance_2_mini`, `minimax_h3`, `veo_3_1`. Image models: `nano_banana_2_lite`, `nano_banana_2`, `seedream_5_lite`, `gpt_image_2`.

On the web: [image to video](https://emaki.ai/image-to-video) and the [AI video upscaler](https://emaki.ai/video-upscaler). 日本語での使い方は [シーダンス](https://emaki.ai/) へ。]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/hanshs474/emaki-go/releases/tag/v0.1.0</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
